the-firm-as-one-program-38 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-38 = unlines (cons "- **C15** Network and FPGA are targets of the same program ([P7: One evaluator realizes everything, through C (hyperactivity v31 §9)])." (cons "  Firms have spent hundreds of millions on microwave and laser links to send information along the shortest path physics allows between Chicago and New Jersey. The network, the switches, the FPGA and the custom silicon are processes with transition semantics, and latency is an observation of them. With strategy, network and circuit in one program, the firm optimizes the whole path instead of each component in its own vocabulary, and a strategy can be specialized into a verified circuit in days." nil))
